   "heading": {
    "en": "Prescribed law enforcement agency"
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "2. For the purposes of paragraph (e) of the definition of “law enforcement agency” in section 2(1) of the Act, the Corrupt Practices Investigation Bureau is prescribed as a law enforcement agency."
